# NVIDIA proprietary userspace + open kernel modules.
# RTX 50-series (Blackwell, e.g. RTX 5060) is ONLY supported by the open kernel
# modules (nvidia-open); the legacy closed modules do not support it.
# DKMS builds the module for every installed kernel (linux + linux-lts).
nvidia-open-dkms|nvidia-open
nvidia-utils
lib32-nvidia-utils
nvidia-settings
opencl-nvidia
?lib32-opencl-nvidia
libva-nvidia-driver
egl-wayland
?egl-gbm
# CUDA (~4 GB) is not on the ISO; install with:  sudo pacman -S cuda
